", "ur": "اترتا ہے"}}, {"arabic": "الثَّلْجُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "snijeg", "en": "the snow", "bn": "বরফ", "fa": "برف", "fr": "la neige", "id": "salju itu", "tr": "kar", "ur": "برف"}}, {"arabic": "عَلَى", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "na", "en": "on", "bn": "উপর", "fa": "بر", "fr": "sur", "id": "di atas", "tr": "üzerinde", "ur": "پر"}}, {"arabic": "الْجِبَالِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "planine", "en": "the mountains", "bn": "পাহাড়গুলো", "fa": "کوه‌ها", "fr": "les montagnes", "id": "pegunungan", "tr": "dağlar", "ur": "پہاڑ"}}]}, {"arabic": "تَنَزَّلَتِ الْأَمْطَارُ عَلَى الْمَدِينَةِ", "spoken": "audio/26f6cb75878731d7f549.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hiya", "translation": {"bs": "Kiše su se spustile na grad.", "en": "The rains came down on the city.", "bn": "শহরের উপর বৃষ্টি নেমে এল।", "fa": "بارش‌ها بر شهر فرود آمدند.", "fr": "Les pluies sont tombées sur la ville.", "id": "Hujan-hujan turun di kota itu.", "tr": "Yağmurlar şehre indi.", "ur": "شہر پر بارشیں اتریں۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "تَنَزَّلَتِ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "spustile su se", "en": "came down", "bn": "নেমে এল", "fa": "فرود آمدند", "fr": "sont tombées", "id": "turun", "tr": "indiler", "ur": "اتریں"}}, {"arabic": "الْأَمْطَارُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "kiše", "en": "the rains", "bn": "বৃষ্টিগুলো", "fa": "بارش‌ها", "fr": "les pluies", "id": "hujan", "tr": "yağmurlar", "ur": "بارشیں"}}, {"arabic": "عَلَى", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "na", "en": "on", "bn": "উপর", "fa": "بر", "fr": "sur", "id": "di atas", "tr": "üzerinde", "ur": "پر"}}, {"arabic": "الْمَدِينَةِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "grad", "en": "the city", "bn": "শহরের", "fa": "شهر", "fr": "la ville", "id": "kota itu", "tr": "şehir", "ur": "شہر"}}]}, {"arabic": "نَتَنَزَّلُ مِنَ الْجَبَلِ بِحَذَرٍ", "spoken": "audio/94fd03152e2273970243.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "translation": {"bs": "Oprezno silazimo s planine.", "en": "We come down from the mountain with caution.", "bn": "আমরা সতর্কতার সঙ্গে পাহাড় থেকে নেমে আসি।", "fa": "ما با احتیاط از کوه پایین می‌آییم.", "fr": "Nous descendons de la montagne avec prudence.", "id": "Kami turun dari gunung dengan hati-hati.", "tr": "Dağdan dikkatle ineriz.", "ur": "ہم احتیاط سے پہاڑ سے اترتے ہیں۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "نَتَنَزَّلُ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "silazimo", "en": "come down", "bn": "আমরা নেমে আসি", "fa": "فرود می‌آییم", "fr": "nous descendons", "id": "kami turun", "tr": "ineriz", "ur": "ہم اترتے ہیں"}}, {"arabic": "مِنَ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "s", "en": "from", "bn": "থেকে", "fa": "از", "fr": "de", "id": "dari", "tr": "-den", "ur": "سے"}}, {"arabic": "الْجَبَلِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "planine", "en": "the mountain", "bn": "পাহাড়", "fa": "کوه", "fr": "la montagne", "id": "gunung", "tr": "dağ", "ur": "پہاڑ"}}, {"arabic": "بِحَذَرٍ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "oprezno", "en": "with caution", "bn": "সতর্কতার সাথে", "fa": "با احتیاط", "fr": "avec prudence", "id": "dengan hati-hati", "tr": "dikkatle", "ur": "احتیاط سے"}}]}]}